直线\(MN\)与渐近线\(y=\frac{x}{2}\)的交点记为\(G\)，与渐近线\(y=-\frac{x}{2}\)的交点记为\(H\). 代入\(Xx+4Yy=4\)，得\(G=\left(\frac{4}{X+2Y},\frac{2}{X+2Y}\right)\)，\(H=\left(\frac{4}{X-2Y},-\frac{2}{X-2Y}\right)\). 因此\[\overrightarrow{OG}\cdot\overrightarrow{OH}
=\frac{16}{(X+2Y)(X-2Y)}-\frac{4}{(X+2Y)(X-2Y)}
